  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Turkiye Energy Sector Support Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to: (i) identify low-carbon energy technologies to be deployed by BOTAS, (ii) increase MENR&#x2019;s capacity to promote awareness of households on energy efficiency benefits, (iii) build EMRA&#x2019;s capacity to increase the level of trust and market depth in natural gas market and, (iv) improve TEIAS&#x2019;s capacity for enhanced electricity grid operations.</narrative>
  </description>
